      "en": "Destruction on destruction is decreed, for the whole land is laid waste. Suddenly my tents are destroyed, and my curtains gone in a moment.",
      "ko": "패망에 패망이 연속하여 온 땅이 탈취를 당하니 나의 천막은 홀연히 파멸되며 나의 휘장은 잠시간에 열파되도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8b44a659ff2e38245d3204cc14421f117a423b12683f8dd41a98c1ec7097448c",
      "translation_text_hash": "2909e92f7e5324874d7974f0299e3e5a6ab609cb60233effce9399d742de7318",
